Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=74}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:06.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You pathetic, little maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:09.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You would knowingly\Nattack the invincible fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of pirates commanded by\NCaptain Usopp of the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:18.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Attack them! Show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:25.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geez. I really\Nexpected you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to be a little bit\Nmore lively than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:31.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh, heh. Look! Our pirate mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now that Usopp's joined, we got four people,\Nthat's almost a whole crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.94,0:02:37.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time\Nwe got our own flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that really gonna be our mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Whaddya think? Nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our mark should be scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It should strike fear\Ninto our enemies' hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:51.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If our enemies were terrified infants,\Nthen this would be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys really should've\Ntold me about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe you didn't know this about me,\Nbut I am an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:00.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you can draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:03.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. When it comes to painting,\NI'm in a league of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:07.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been drawing graffiti\Nfor fifty years straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:12.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Behold! A priceless work of pirate art!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:13.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:16.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks a lot like you\Non that flag. Jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, how do you like this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:24.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow. That's actually\Npretty good, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Keep it! That's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, we've finally settled on it.\NThis is gonna be our mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp! Draw one on the sail, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:33.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! It's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0} has everything\Nshe could possibly need!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah... I'm pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:56.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we going the right way?\NSeems kinda dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:57.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:00.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep. There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:07.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do ya see out there?\NIs it something cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The legendary Treasure Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean the Treasure Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even I've heard of that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:15.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm not surprised,\Nthis place is famous
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:18.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the world over. And so are\Nthe crazy stories about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What crazy stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:22.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that\Nwhoever's dumb enough
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to sail close to the island\Nincurs a god's wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we know that all those\Nstories were true, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a god's wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think that sounds pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey, wait! We're not gonna...\N– You bet we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Treasure Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:32.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:33.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nap time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:38.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can he possibly sleep\Nin such a creepy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's either dumb,\Nor he's got nerves of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's happening?! Are we in danger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I was just making up\Na little dance to liven things up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. Come on, stop that, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:12.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Who's there?!\N– Leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:24.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys? Where's that voice coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am\Nthe vengeful island god!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave at once if you value your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:31.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Island god?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait.\NYou guys are pirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah... I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:40.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would a god need\Nto ask something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:43.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I dunno. I-I mean,\Ntake one more step into the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The instant you do,\Nyou will instantly receive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:50.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}my divine punishment and meet your doom,\Nwhich is my punishment. Wait, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. That made no sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This guy is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:55.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. What's his deal, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did\Nyou say, straw hat boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They used to be humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:12.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They came looking for treasure,\Nbut all they found was my wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:16.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. You transformed them?!\NThen you are a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:19.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at all these weird things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:20.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. So, is this a pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could be a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:29.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stretchy\Nfreak of nature! What are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One time I ate a devil fruit.\NSo now I'm a rubber person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.\NA devil fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:38.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard those same stupid stories\Nback when I was a pirate, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Back when you were a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:41.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh...\NNo! I wasn't reminiscing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:44.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about the old days!\NEnough of that kinda talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear about\Nthe old days! Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? {\i1}You're{\i0} the one\Nwho brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:50.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You faker! You sound\Ntoo dumb to be a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:54.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2} Shut up! If you won't leave,\Nthen prepare for my divine judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're really pushing\Nyour luck... "god."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How are you not dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.41,0:08:09.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– There you are.\N– Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, "island god."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even mortals know\Nbullets can't hurt a rubber man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe not, but I still hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're\Nsome kind of monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:27.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:30.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. Found his gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:36.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could it be the island god?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:47.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:08:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stand me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stand me up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.32,0:09:01.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awesome! He's like\Na talking scrub brush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it? You're not\Neven a minor deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're more like a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on! Stand me up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:12.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relax. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:16.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There. You're all set now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a pretty\Npopular guy, Mr. Island God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:27.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So lemme get this straight, these crazy\Nanimals helped you scare off the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who came to this place\Nlooking for treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a person stuffed\Ninside a treasure chest before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:35.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a real-life "jack-in-the-box."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:40.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. Ironically, I am in fact\Nin a box, and my name is... You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a person! Not a toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:45.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been stranded,\Nalone, on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:48.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and stuck in this contemptible box\Nfor twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:49.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That long?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you've been all alone on this island\Nfor twenty years? Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:04.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just take a look at me.\NI got a beard like a wild man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And in all that time,\Nyou're the first people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that I've had a real conversation with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:11.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you understand how painful that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:17.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh... here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been looking\Nall over for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:22.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could you have slept through\Neverything that's just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He finally sees him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:37.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Check it out! He's in a treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like a "jack-in-the-box." But real!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. Ironically, I am in fact\Nin a box, and my name is... You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've already been through all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Gimme a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oww! What are you doing?!\NStop it, would you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're pulling my head off! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm afraid you're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:11:01.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been stuck inside this blasted\Ntreasure chest for so many years now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:03.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that it's slowly become\Na part of my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you try to break it,\Nyou'll break my body, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a strange little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:11.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, guys,\Nenough about me, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:15.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're not like any of those other pirates\Nwho've come around here, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then I'm gonna be\NKing of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.27,0:11:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The One Piece?!\NDon't tell me you idiots
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are actually planning\Nto sail on the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yup! We got a chart right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line's a graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I once saw a group of pirates\Nwho had managed to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.69,0:11:37.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from that horrible place,\Nand I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was an awful sight.\NThey were just the hollow shells
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the men that they used to be.\NThere's no telling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what horrors they witnessed\Nin that ghastly place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not one among them even tried to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:49.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me well, young pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rumors of the One Piece\Nspawn more rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows what's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:58.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been only twenty-odd\Nyears since the start
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the Great Pirate Era,\Nand the One Piece is already
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a dream within a dream beyond a legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:08.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, which one of these\Nis the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I dunno. Figured you could tell me,\NMr. Scrub Brush Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I never learned\Nhow to read a sea chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:15.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never did, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ignorance is bliss, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, even if we do somehow\Nmake it to the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}the best idea would be to get\Nas much treasure as we can and then escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You go ahead and do that,\NI'm gonna find the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where do you get\Nall that confidence of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll get it! You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:37.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:40.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:41.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:44.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're exactly like me.\NYou even look like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We could be twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you say he looks like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Young man. I understand about\Nthe pursuit of your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I was a younger man,\Nwe used to feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:58.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We were willing to put our lives on the line\Nto search for treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It was that single-minded zeal\Nthat changed the course of my life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:03.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. Slow down.\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:07.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It happened twenty years ago...\NI was a much younger man then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:10.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}My fellow pirates and I\Nlanded on this island with a single purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:15.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To find the treasure\Nthat was said to rest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:23.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2} Two hundred men have searched for\Nan entire month, and nothing has been found!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:26.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The only treasure chest\Nwe've uncovered is empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pack up, men! We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you\Nlooking at, Gaimon? It's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:36.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:40.28,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Did anyone look way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:44.26,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that the captain stayed\Ndown here the whole month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:49.60,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd better go ahead\Nand double-check.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:58.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! I found it. Guys, it's up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:16.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's when\NI got stuck in this chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:21.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I came to, my crew\Nwas already far out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:30.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Yes. I believe this means that\Nthe entire fortune belongs to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:37.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't climb up like this!\NI can't get out! I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:42.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2020)\t(3939,3980,\alpha&HFF&)}Hey! Come back! Come back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And after all this time,\Nthe fortune I found but only saw
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for an instant has never strayed\Nfar from my lonely old mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:53.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Pirates have come here countless times\Nto search for my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:56.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But fortunately, my friends here\Nhelp me scare them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:15:02.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's how I've kept my treasure\Nsafe and sound for the past twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:07.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No question. It's yours, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:08.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, I think we can help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:12.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gaimon, why don't we get\Nthe treasure down for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:14.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:14.56,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:16.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:19.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you a thief\Nthat only steals from pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am a thief, but I have a conscience!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:47.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:51.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the place.\NIt's all up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.61,0:15:57.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:58.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a great day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:00.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get to it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sure thing! Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:09.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)} ...Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:20.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! The chests! You see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:27.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found 'em! Six treasure chests!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's mine! I got my treasure!\NC'mon, toss it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:38.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna see it! Go ahead\Nand toss it down, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:41.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:46.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna. Sucks for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of crap is that, Luffy?\NGive the man his gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not joking around, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:58.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:02.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}not{\i0} all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:04.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gaimon. You've been\Nguarding that treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:06.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with your heart and soul\Nfor the past twenty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:10.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a great guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:14.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. What do you mean he's great?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:19.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I always had an inkling that...\Nthis might be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:22.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I tried not to think\Nabout it. But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:31.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep. Every last one of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:36.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How sad. The treasure he guarded for twenty\Nlong years was just a bunch of empty boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:41.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2} It happens all the time with\Ntreasures that have maps leading to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You set out on a quest to find it,\Nbut someone else got to it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:48.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's the kind of risk you have to take\Nwhen you're a treasure-hunting pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You can waste a whole lifetime\Nsearching and never once touch treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:56.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Plenty of pirates lived\Nlike that. Believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:18:01.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Try not to\Nbe too upset, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing we came along\Nafter twenty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thirty years later, and\Nyou might've been dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Luffy...\N– Is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since this treasure hunt's a bust,\Nyou're gonna need
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,something else to fill your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you join up with us\Nand search for the One Piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Really? You're asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... I know how I must look to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Other people wouldn't even\Nspeak to me, but you were kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been so many years since\NI've had a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:40.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you wanna\Nstay on the island, Gaimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:57.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure. There's something\Nhere far more valuable
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:18:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than treasure that\NI feel I must protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:00.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Worth more than gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:08.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}For the past twenty years, these guys have\Nstood by my side through thick and thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't leave 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that I know\Nthere's no treasure here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:23.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I somehow finally feel free.\NWithout that heavy burden,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can concentrate on the things\Nthat really matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And besides, after all these years,\NI've grown fond of this little box.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:33.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too bad! You're a neat guy.\NPretty cool for a scrub brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The weird creatures here\Nare your true friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:38.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep! And he's\Nthe weirdest of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:52.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya! Take care, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.55,0:19:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bye, Gaimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:58.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't ever give up on making\Nall your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:05.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the legendary One Piece\Nexists out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then it's yours.\NI hope it finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And when you have it, buy the world!
Comment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:05.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=75}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:05.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=72}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
